{
 "id": 1044867,
 "titulo": "3.8 Patch Notes (Updated)",
 "fecha": 1517892216699,
 "modificada": 1732982290011,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1044867",
 "html": "<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; background: #fdfdfd;\">Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.<br>\n<!-- [if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\n<!--[endif]--></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; background: #fdfdfd;\">It’s time to show you the latest additions to Marvel Future Fight! This update will bring you new characters and new contents! Take a look at what the update will bring.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Tiems;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; background: #fdfdfd;\">Three new characters: Shuri, Ulysses Klaue, and Killmonger, and three new uniforms will be added!<br>\nAdded a New Legendary Battle inspired by Marvel’s <em>Black Panther</em> and a New Challenge content, “Daily Trivia”!</span><br>\n<br>\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"youtube_thumb\" data-video-key=\"e1tDBUp1JNE\" height=\"auto\" id=\"1588934426312\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/e1tDBUp1JNE/sddefault.jpg\"><br>\n<!-- [if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\n<!--[endif]--></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Tiems;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span> <strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ff6c00;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Three New Characters</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Tiems;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; background: #fdfdfd;\">&nbsp;Shuri, Ulysses Klaue, and Erik Killmonger have been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; background: #fdfdfd;\">Along with these new Characters, new Team Bonuses and new Challenges have been added.</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180206/iwhw1517888428467.png\"></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180206/qzfk1517888430466.png\"></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180208/2zdw1518079076056.png\"></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; background: #fdfdfd;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #c00000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #c00000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"> Shuri and Ulysses Klaue can be obtained through the Premium Hero Chest in the Store and Selector: Biometrics.&nbsp;</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #c00000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #c00000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"> Killmonger is available from the ‘Get 20 Biometrics daily’ package.</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #c00000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #c00000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"> <span lang=\"EN-US\">Stats are based on skill Lv. 1</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Tiems;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ff6c00;\"> Three New Uniforms</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Tiems; color: #000000;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; background: #fdfdfd;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">&nbsp;New Uniforms for Black Panther, <span style=\"background: white; mso-shading-themecolor: background1;\">Shuri, and Killmonger</span> have been added.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; background: #fdfdfd;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #c00000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180205/wtb21517795594240.png\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; background: #fdfdfd;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #c00000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180205/dksa1517795592182.png\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180206/xzpj1517888429477.png\"></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; background: #fdfdfd;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #c00000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"> Marvel’s <em>Black Panther</em> Uniform can only be acquired through the Black Panther - Extreme Package.</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"> Black Panther, Shuri, and Killmonger’s new Uniforms have different price point and higher upgrade material requirements with higher stats compared to other uniforms.</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"> Shuri and Killmonger’s Uniforms will be on sale for a limited period. You will be able to check them in the Marvel Universe/ Uniform Room in the Shop.</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">※</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"> <span lang=\"EN-US\">Black Panther's new Uniform will not be discounted in the Uniform Sale event</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Tiems;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; color: #ff6c00;\"> New Legendary Battle</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Tiems; color: #000000;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; background: #fdfdfd;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">Cinematic Battle mode has been renamed to Legendary Battle mode and a new Legendary Battle has been added. This battle will present Black Panther and Shuri defending the land of Wakanda.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; background: #fdfdfd;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #c00000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180205/6byj1517795693888.png\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br>\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; color: #0070c0;\">- You can choose between Marvel’s <em>Thor: Ragnarok</em> or Marvel’s <em>Black Panther</em> when you enter the Legendary Battle mode</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; background: #fdfdfd; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">The Marvel’s <em>Black Panther</em> Legendary Battle is composed of three (3) stages that can be played between Normal and Extreme difficulty. However, Extreme difficulty is only accessible once the “Black Panther: Extreme” Package is purchased.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; background: #fdfdfd; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180207/0hhs1517969200695.png\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; color: #0070c0;\">- You need to purchase the Black Panther: Extreme Package to enter the Extreme Difficulty.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems;\">[5/8 10:31 a.m. (UTC+0) / 5/8 3:31 a.m. (PDT) added]<br>\n- Legendary Battle Extreme Mode will unlock immediately upon purchase and cannot be refunded.<br>\n- Legendary Battle Extreme Mode can be used continuously after purchase.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; color: #0070c0;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180205/g2yy1517795801718.png\"></span><br>\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; color: #0070c0;\">- Both Normal and Extreme Difficulty have 3 stages</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems;\">The rules for Marvel’s <em>Black Panther</em>’s Stage is same as Marvel’s <em>Thor: Ragnarok</em>’s Legendary Battle where the stats of your character are fixed.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems;\">You will receive a Legendary Battle Completion Reward Chest and a bonus reward based on your character’s level and uniform’s rank.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems;\">Bonus reward is based on the level of your character and uniform.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180205/byvk1517795845814.png\"></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Tiems;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #c00000;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp;The Legendary Battle Completion Reward Chest will be sent to your mailbox.</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #c00000;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp;Bonus rewards will be awarded when the stage is cleared and the bonus condition has been met.&nbsp;</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #c00000;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp;Bonus rewards are only available once per account.</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #c00000;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp;The number of times you can get Daily Rewards is shared by all difficulties and stories.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Tiems;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ff6c00;\"> Daily Trivia</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; color: #000000;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">A new content has been added on the Challenge Menu. The Daily Trivia will test your in-game and Marvel Universe knowledge.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; color: #c00000;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180205/qjn91517795954313.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; color: #c00000;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #000000;\">The Daily Trivia is composed of five questions with four choices, all based on the information found in-game.<br>\nYou can earn Basic Rewards upon solving the trivia and an additional reward depending if your answer is correct or not.</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">※</span> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">Daily Trivia will reset daily at 15:00 (UTC) / 07:00 AM (PST).</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; color: #c00000;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180206/5cw41517888426593.png\"></span></span></span><br>\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; color: #c00000;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #0070c0;\">- The bonus rewards that you will receive is based if your answer is right or wrong.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; color: #c00000;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #0070c0;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180205/o9rj1517795956039.png\"></span></span></span></span><br>\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; color: #0070c0;\">- If you take all of the trivia, you will be able to view all the questions and answers for that day.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Tiems;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ff6c00;\"> <span lang=\"EN-US\">New Boosters</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems;\">Two new Boosters have been added to the Shop. The ‘Premium Anti-Matter Booster’ increases the Anti-Matter production in the S.H.I.E.L.D. Lab. While the 'Daily Boost’ provides Boost Points and an even stronger Boost Effect.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; color: #000000;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">1. Premium Anti-Matter Booster</span></strong></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems; color: #000000;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180205/xd8z1517796181173.png\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems;\">Similar with the existing Boosters in the Store &gt; Featured Shop, this can be purchased with Crystals.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">This item increases Anti-Matter acquisition by 100% for 3 days.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180205/ekfm1517796180367.png\"></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180205/em7d1517796182301.png\"></span></span></span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Tiems;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: #0070c0;\">&nbsp;- After making purchase, effects can be checked in the lobby and the S.H.I.E.L.D. Lab!</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Tiems;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">2. Daily Boost Points</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Tiems;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Boost Points will be issued daily for 30 days immediately after purchase.</span><br>\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">This is a monthly product that will enhance the existing Boost effect.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180205/1xqm1517796299925.png\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Tiems;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span> <strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ff6c00;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">UI Changes</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #333333;\">Some of the UI in the game has been changed for your convenience:</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #333333;\">1. Inventory tab is changed, so bulk enhancements of Comic Cards can be done here.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #333333;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180205/brx31517796368897.png\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #333333;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">2. Added a feature to see how much excess stats a hero has exceeded in the Hero Details screen.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #333333;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180205/qywd1517796369811.png\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #333333;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">3.</span> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">My Team icon added to some Missions that did not contain it before. This icon redirects you from the Mission lobby to your My Team page to adjust your active roster.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Tiems;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #333333;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180205/p9ja1517796449331.png\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #333333;\">4. Marvel Universe icon has been added to Hero Information screen.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #333333;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180205/r0fk1517796448440.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #333333;\">5. Special Mission Quest Pack has been changed to allow you to check the name of each achievement's reward item.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #333333;\">6. Improved the animation when using EXP Chips.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #333333;\">7. Tool tip text of the Auto Repeat function has been changed.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #333333;\">8. Better aligning mechanism selecting Not-Yet-Acquired character in Character search function</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #333333;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">9. Comic Card information now shows where to obtain them.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #333333;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180205/vlkq1517796523877.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #333333;\">10. New friend confirmation pop-up will no longer be displayed, allowing to make new friend request immediately afterwards.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Tiems;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-hansi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ff6c00;\"> Other Changes</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #333333;\">1. The expiration of the Timeline Battle Ranking rewards has been changed from unlimited to 7 days in the Mailbox.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #333333;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">2. More option using Crystals as material for the S.H.I.E.L.D. Lab Processor has been added.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #333333;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/COMMON/20180205/rexp1517796576324.png\"></span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Tiems;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: #0070c0;\">&nbsp;- You can now use Crystals as materials in the Processor up to certain times a day.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #333333;\">3. Fixed an issue wherein using Apocalypse's 'Fear Fragment’ skill in Timeline Battle does not apply the effect of health regeneration.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #333333;\">4. This update has fixed the following known issues:</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #0070c0;\">- Adam Warlock’s portrait does not show the frame of Tier-2 Character when purchasing him from the Shop - Buy Again button is shown when purchasing Adam Warlock from Shop</span><br>\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #0070c0;\">- An issue where Event Battle progress shown and progress recorded are different.</span><br>\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #0070c0;\">- Issue where displayed stats for Unowned Uniform does not match with actual number of Uniforms available.</span><br>\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #0070c0;\">- Issue where the view on ‘Rumble mode’ in Shadowland is farther than it should be.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #333333;\">5. Fixed the issue wherein the character combinations in all team slots are automatically assigned to same characters.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tiems; color: #333333;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">6. Fixed an issue with Squirrel Girl’s skill, “Squirrel Army” animation not showing properly.</span></span></span></span></p>\n"
